messages = PoolStringArray( "CHARACTER_LOCAL_ISAAC", "以撒", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_HARVESTING", "收穫屬性加成為125%", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_STARTING_BUNNIES", "開局攜帶1個兔子", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_STARTING_D6", "開局攜帶1個六面骰", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_D6", "六面骰", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_D6", "每次商店刷新有{0}%機率使下次刷新免費。", "LOCAL_ISAAC_D6_FREE_REROLLS_EARNED", "獲得的免費刷新次數：{0}次", "WEAPON_LOCAL_ISAAC_TEAR", "淚彈", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_STARTING_TEAR", "開局攜帶1把淚彈", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_WIRE_COAT_HANGER", "鐵絲衣架", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_TRUMPET", "小號", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_LUCKY_RABBIT_FOOT", "幸運兔腳", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_CUPIDS_ARROW", "丘比特之箭", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_BELT", "皮帶", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_HOLY_WAFER", "聖餅", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_HOLY_WAFER", "受到的傷害減少{0}%。", "WEAPON_CLASS_LOCAL_ISAAC_TEARS", "眼淚", "WEAPON_CLASS_LOCAL_ISAAC_RANGED", "遠程", "STAT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOMBS", "炸彈", "CONSUMABLE_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOMB", "炸彈", "INFO_POS_STAT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOMBS", "炸彈庫存：{0}。自動攻擊500範圍內的石頭，每次消耗1個，造成固定100點基礎爆炸傷害，爆炸範圍受屬性加成。", "INFO_NEG_STAT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOMBS", "炸彈庫存不會低於0。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_ROCK", "石頭", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_ROCKS", "更多石頭（+{0}）。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_MR_BOMB", "炸彈先生", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_MR_BOMB", "獲得{0}個炸彈。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOMB_BOGO", "炸彈買一送一", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOMB_BOGO", "所有掉落的炸彈變為每份{0}個炸彈。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_MOMS_KNIFE", "媽刀", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_MOMS_KNIFE", "所有武器累計攻擊{0}次後，射出與攜帶武器數量相同的無限貫通媽刀，造成最高武器傷害{1}倍的傷害。最快每{2}秒觸發一次。", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_STARTING_BOMB", "開局攜帶{0}個炸彈", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_ROCK_BOTTOM", "谷底石", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_ROCK_BOTTOM", "自身屬性不會低於獲得此道具後的歷史最高值（炸彈除外）。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_LIGHT_CROWN", "光明王冠", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_LIGHT_CROWN", "滿生命時，{2}+{0}%；本波受到傷害後，滿生命加成變為+{1}%。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_MONEY_EQUALS_POWER", "金錢=力量", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_MONEY_EQUALS_POWER", "每持有{0}個材料，{2}+{1}%。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SOY_MILK", "豆奶", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_SOY_MILK", "{1}+{0}%，造成的最終傷害×{2}。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_DOUBLE_VISION", "雙重視力", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_DOUBLE_VISION", "遠程武器投射物+{0}。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOBS_BRAIN", "鮑勃的腦子", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOBS_BRAIN", "生成一個鮑勃的腦子，接觸敵人後爆炸造成{0}範圍傷害，並使敵人中毒，每秒造成{1}傷害，持續{2}秒。{3}秒後復活。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_EIGHT_INCH_NAILS", "八寸釘", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_EIGHT_INCH_NAILS", "每把遠程武器每次攻擊有{0}%機率射出無限貫通的釘子，造成武器傷害。機率受{1}影響，每20{1}增加{3}%。\n遠程武器擊退+{2}。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_IPECAC", "吐根酊", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_IPECAC", "每把武器每攻擊{0}次觸發一次爆炸：遠程射出爆炸淚彈，近戰命中時爆炸，造成武器基礎傷害（{1}）的範圍傷害，並使敵人中毒，每秒造成{2}傷害，持續{3}秒。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_TOUGH_LOVE", "嚴厲的愛", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_TOUGH_LOVE", "每把武器每次攻擊有{0}%機率造成{1}倍傷害（與暴擊相乘）。機率受{2}影響，每10{2}增加{3}%。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_POLYPHEMUS", "巨人獨眼", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_POLYPHEMUS", "{1}+{0}%，最終{3}×{2}。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_MILK", "牛奶", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SNACK", "小零食", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_GHOST_BABY", "幽靈寶寶", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_GHOST_BABY", "生成一個幽靈寶寶，射出無限貫通的幽靈淚彈，造成{0}傷害。", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_SISTER_MAGGY", "生成一個瑪姬姐妹，射出淚彈造成{0}傷害。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_BROTHER_BOBBY", "波比兄弟", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SISTER_MAGGY", "瑪姬姐妹", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_RAINBOW_BABY", "生成一個彩虹寶寶，隨機射出燃燒、爆炸、中毒、普通或幽靈淚彈，分別造成{0}/{1}/{2}/{3}/{4}傷害。燃燒和中毒每秒造成{5}傷害，持續{6}秒。", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BROTHER_BOBBY", "生成一個波比兄弟，射出淚彈造成{0}傷害。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_RAINBOW_BABY", "彩虹寶寶", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_INCUBUS", "淫魔", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_LITTLE_STEVEN", "生成一個史蒂文寶寶，射出淚彈造成{0}傷害，使敵人減速{2}%，可貫通{1}個敵人。", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_SUCCUBUS", "生成一個魅魔。在其光環內每{0}秒獲得+{1}%{2}，持續至本波結束；離開光環後重新計時。", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_INCUBUS", "生成一個淫魔，環繞玩家並以{0}%傷害複製當前傷害最高武器的攻擊。未裝備武器時使用紫色淚彈。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_DEMON_BABY", "惡魔寶寶", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_SERAPHIM", "生成一個撒拉弗，射出可貫通{1}個敵人的淚彈，造成{0}傷害。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_LITTLE_STEVEN", "史蒂文寶寶", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SUCCUBUS", "魅魔", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_DEMON_BABY", "生成一個固定不動的惡魔寶寶，射出淚彈造成{0}傷害。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SERAPHIM", "撒拉弗", "EFFECT_LOCAL_LILITH_STARTING_PETS", "開局攜帶淫魔和好朋友一輩子", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BEST_FRIENDS_FOREVER", "所有寵物造成的最終傷害×{0}，魅魔的光環加成×{0}。", "CHARACTER_LOCAL_LILITH", "莉莉絲", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_BEST_FRIENDS_FOREVER", "好朋友一輩子", "EFFECT_LOCAL_LILITH_CHOOSE_PET", "初始可選擇任意白色寵物道具", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_TAURUS", "金牛座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_TAURUS", "戰鬥中每秒獲得+{0}%{3}，最多+{1}%。達到上限後無敵{2}秒，每波觸發一次。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_ARIES", "白羊座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_ARIES", "每波{2}達到{0}%時，獲得{1}次免傷。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_CANCER", "巨蟹座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_CANCER", "每波生命首次低於50%後，本波受到的傷害減少{0}%。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_LEO", "狮子座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_LEO", "接觸樹木或石頭時立即摧毀。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_VIRGO", "室女座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_VIRGO", "受到傷害後的無敵時間×{0}。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_LIBRA", "天秤座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_LIBRA", "獲得時，按{0}%{3}、{1}%{4}和{2}{5}的升級權重，均分這三項目前屬性。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SCORPIO", "天蠍座", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SAGITTARIUS", "人馬座", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_CAPRICORN", "摩羯座", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_PISCES", "雙魚座", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_AQUARIUS", "寶瓶座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_SCORPIO", "武器命中時使敵人中毒，每{2}秒造成{0}傷害，共{1}次。中毒可蔓延至附近{3}個敵人。", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_AQUARIUS", "每{0}秒釋放一次水波，推開範圍內的敵人，並使其減速{1}%，持續{2}秒。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_GEMINI", "双子座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_GEMINI", "每波隨機選擇一個已持有的自製寵物，複製{0}個，僅本波生效。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_DRESSED_BOY", "盛装男孩", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_DRESSED_BOY", "隨機獲得{0}點屬性。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_RAW_MEAT", "生肉", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_MOMS_EYESHADOW", "妈妈的眼影", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_MOMS_EYESHADOW", "每次武器攻擊有{0}%機率使敵人魅惑{1}秒。每{2}{5}增加{3}%機率，最高{4}%。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_LOST_CONTACT", "丢失的隐形眼镜", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_LOST_CONTACT", "每次武器攻擊有{0}%機率消除本次彈丸或揮砍碰到的敵方彈幕。每{2}{5}增加{3}%機率，最高{4}%。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_MAGIC_SCAB", "魔法血痂", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_ABADDON_BABY", "亚巴顿宝宝", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_ABADDON_BABY", "生成一個亞巴頓寶寶，每{1}秒對周圍敵人造成{0}範圍傷害。", "LOCAL_ISAAC_GEMINI_CURRENT", "本波複製：{0}", "LOCAL_ISAAC_GEMINI_EMPTY", "沒有可複製的自製寵物。", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_MAX_HP", "最大生命{0}%", "LOCAL_ISAAC_EYESHADOW_CHARMS", "魅惑敵人：{0}次", "LOCAL_ISAAC_PROJECTILES_CLEARED", "消除敵方彈幕：{0}個", "LOCAL_ISAAC_BOMBS_GAINED", "獲得炸彈：{0}個", "CHARACTER_LOCAL_MAGDALENE", "抹大拉", "CHARACTER_LOCAL_CAIN", "該隱", "CHARACTER_LOCAL_BLUE_BABY", "小藍人", "CHARACTER_LOCAL_JUDAS", "猶大", "CHARACTER_LOCAL_KEEPER", "店長", "CHARACTER_LOCAL_FORGOTTEN", "遺骸", "WEAPON_LOCAL_ISAAC_SPIRIT_SWORD", "英靈劍", "WEAPON_LOCA